# Optional RAW ingest extras
# Platform-scoped due to wheel availability differences.
# No checked-in RAW lock is generated from this file. The root
# `make install-ml-raw` target fails closed until a trusted target-correct
# RAW lock contract exists again.
#
# WARNING:
# - rawpy wheel availability varies by platform/architecture
# - macOS Intel (x86_64) requires 0.25.1 (0.26.x wheels not available)
# - All other platforms use 0.26.1 for latest LibRaw features
#
# Capability contract:
# - This is an OPTIONAL metadata layer. Absence downgrades ingest to non-RAW paths.
# - Do not install from a missing ml-raw.txt host lock artifact.
# - Re-enabling RAW install support requires a governed checked-in lock.

# RAW file processing (LibRaw wrapper for CR2, NEF, ARW, DNG, etc.)
# Platform-specific version pins due to wheel availability:
# - macOS Intel (x86_64): use older 0.25.1 (0.26.x wheels unavailable)
# - All other platforms (Linux, Windows, macOS ARM): use 0.26.1
rawpy==0.26.1 ; platform_system == "Darwin" and platform_machine == "x86_64"  # Wheel availability
rawpy==0.26.1 ; platform_system != "Darwin"  # Wheel availability
rawpy==0.26.1 ; platform_system == "Darwin" and platform_machine != "x86_64"  # Wheel availability
